Build a complete website for the following brief with layout: grid.

<content_brief>
  <business_name>Golden Crumb Bakery</business_name>
  <tagline>Handcrafted Sourdough and Parisian Patisserie</tagline>
  <business_type>bakery</business_type>
  <layout_archetype>grid</layout_archetype>
  <layout_guidelines>Balanced multi-column card grid (2-3 columns on desktop, 1 on mobile) with uniform card heights, subtle borders, and consistent gap rhythm.</layout_guidelines>
  <motion_guidelines>Grid Motion: Implement staggered fade/slide-in on scroll for cards via IntersectionObserver (staggered by index with 60ms delay increment), plus subtle hover lift (translateY(-3px)). Mandatory reduced-motion fallback: @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .card, .card:hover, .card.is-visible { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; transition: none !important; } }</motion_guidelines>
  <primary_color>#221914</primary_color>
  <accent_color>#d97706</accent_color>
  <font_heading>Cinzel</font_heading>
  <font_body>Inter</font_body>
  <sections>header, hero, bakes, footer</sections>
  <item name="Country Sourdough Boule" tag="$9.50" description="36-hour cold ferment with stone-ground heritage whole wheat and caramelized blistered crust." />
  <item name="Cardamom Almond Croissant" tag="$6.25" description="Twice-baked laminated viennoiserie soaked in orange blossom syrup with toasted almond frangipane." />
  <item name="Valrhona Chocolate Babka" tag="$14.00" description="Brioche loaf braided with 70% dark chocolate fudge, Ceylon cinnamon, and crystal sugar syrup." />
  <item name="Miso Hazelnut Kouign-Amann" tag="$5.75" description="Breton butter pastry caramelized with salted white miso honey and roasted Piedmont hazelnuts." />
  <contact>
    <address>144 Artisan Way, Portland, OR 97209</address>
    <phone>+1 (503) 555-0182</phone>
    <email>orders@goldencrumb.com</email>
    <hours>Wed–Sun: 7am–3pm (or until sold out)</hours>
  </contact>
</content_brief>

You will build the site ONE SECTION AT A TIME. Start with the first section now.

FIRST SECTION REQUIRED: Write the Header section: a sticky navigation bar with the business name/logo on the left, navigation links (Home, Pastries & Breads, Contact) on the right, plus 'Pre-Order Bakes' CTA button. Files: src/components/Header.tsx + src/components/Header.css

Previous assistant implementation (context only):
<tool_call name="write_site">
<file path="src/components/Hero.tsx">
import React from 'react';
import './Hero.css';

export function Hero() {
  return (
    <section className="gc-hero gc-hero--grid" id="hero" aria-labelledby="gc-hero-title">
      <div className="gc-hero__inner">
        <div className="gc-hero__badge">
          <span>Golden Crumb Bakery Catalog</span>
        </div>

        <h1 id="gc-hero-title" className="gc-hero__title">
          Handcrafted Sourdough and Parisian Patisserie
        </h1>

        <p className="gc-hero__subtitle">
          Wild-fermented European breads, flaky cultured butter croissants, and seasonal fruit tarts baked fresh before dawn.
        </p>

        <div className="gc-hero__actions">
          <a href="mailto:orders@goldencrumb.com" className="gc-hero__btn-primary">
            Pre-Order Bakes
          </a>
          <a href="#bakes" className="gc-hero__btn-secondary">
            Explore Pastries & Breads
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  );
}

</file>
<file path="src/components/Hero.css">
.gc-hero {
  position: relative;
  min-height: 84vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: #221914;
  padding: 5rem 2rem;
}

.gc-hero__inner {
  max-width: 860px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  text-align: center;
}

.gc-hero__badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  padding: 0.35rem 1rem;
  background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.08);
  border: 1px solid rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.22);
  border-radius: 999px;
  color: #d97706;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.gc-hero__title {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #fafafa;
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
}

.gc-hero__subtitle {
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: #a1a1aa;
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 640px;
  margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
}

.gc-hero__actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1rem;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.gc-hero__btn-primary {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0.85rem 2.2rem;
  background: #d97706;
  color: #0c0d12;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 8px;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.gc-hero__btn-primary:hover {
  background: #b45309;
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.gc-hero__btn-secondary {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 0.85rem 2.2rem;
  background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.04);
  color: #fafafa;
  border: 1px solid rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.32);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 8px;
  transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

.gc-hero__btn-secondary:hover {
  border-color: #d97706;
  color: #d97706;
}

.gc-hero__inner {
  animation: gcEditorialHeroFade 0.65s ease-out;
}

@keyframes gcEditorialHeroFade {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .gc-hero__inner,
  .gc-hero__btn-primary,
  .gc-hero__btn-secondary {
    animation: none !important;
    transition: none !important;
    transform: none !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
  }
}

</file>
</tool_call>

